  "description": "The onemedia command line tool: inspect media containers, edit tags, remux, trim, make files playable, strip location and device identifiers, repair damaged files and rebuild cut-off recordings, and convert and extract subtitles. Remux also writes MPEG-TS/M2TS and WAV/BWF/RF64. `package` writes CMAF or transport-stream segments with HLS playlists and a DASH MPD (preview). Containers, metadata, subtitles; no decoding. Unaffiliated with other products or companies named OneMedia.",
